WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.544
Tell Me About a Mistake.

2
00:00:01.544 --> 00:00:03.286
The interviewer asks for an example

3
00:00:03.286 --> 00:00:04.644
of a mistake you made.

4
00:00:04.644 --> 00:00:07.001
What do you do? A...

5
00:00:07.001 --> 00:00:10.658
Say you cannot think of any meaningful mistakes. B...

6
00:00:10.658 --> 00:00:14.966
Describe a mistake caused mostly by someone else. C...

7
00:00:14.966 --> 00:00:18.553
Choose a real, appropriate example, own your part,

8
00:00:18.553 --> 00:00:21.967
explain the correction, and show what changed afterward.

9
00:00:21.967 --> 00:00:22.872
D...

10
00:00:22.872 --> 00:00:25.090
Describe a serious unresolved mistake

11
00:00:25.090 --> 00:00:26.425
to prove you are honest.
